        "id": 572518756,
        "iid": 4522,
        "project_id": 34675721,
        "title": "fix(catalog): validate component specs before publishing",
        "description": "## Summary\n\nCheck known catalog component spec fields before sending the publish request. Errors identify the component, file, and field. Unknown top-level keys produce a warning and are forwarded for GitLab to validate.\n\nPreserve the existing JSON payload, including null versus empty specs, explicit null input definitions, and input extension keys. GitLab regenerates `inputs_order` in `BuildComponentsService`, so the CLI forwards it as before and leaves ordering to the server.\n\nCloses https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/issues/7699.\n\n## Validation\n\n- The catalog package tests and the release creation catalog regression passed with `go test -race`.\n- `go vet` passed for both packages.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n\nPrepared with AI assistance.",
